#. Tag: para
#: jmoons.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tool displays the positions of Jupiter's four largest moons (Io, Europa, "
"Ganymede, and Callisto) relative to Jupiter, as a function of time. Time is "
"plotted vertically; the units are days and <quote>time=0.0</quote> "
"corresponds to the current simulation time. The horizontal axis displays the "
"angular offset from Jupiter's position, in arcminutes. The offset is measured "
"along the direction of Jupiter's equator. Each moon's position as a function of "
"time traces a sinusoidal path in the plot, as the moon orbits around Jupiter. "
"Each track is assigned a different color to distinguish it from the others; the "
"name labels at the top of the window indicate the color used by each moon."
msgstr ""
"Esta utilidade mostra as posicións das catro lúas maiores de Xúpiter (Io, "
"Europa, Ganímedes e Calisto) en relación a Xúpiter, en función do tempo. "
"O tempo gráfase en vertical, as unidades son días e <quote>tempo=0,0</quote> "
"correspóndese á hora actual da simulacion. O eixo horizontal mostra a "
"distancia angular respeito da posición de Xúpiter, en minutos de arco. O "
"desprazamento mídese ao longo da dirección do ecuador de Xúpiter. A posición de "
"cada lúa en función do tempo traza unha traxectoria sinusoidal no gráfico, xa "
"que a lúa orbita arredor de Xúpiter. Cada traxectoria ten unha cor diferente "
"para distinguila das outras, as lendas na parte de riba da fiestra indican a "
"cor que se emprega para cada lúa."

#. Tag: para
#: jmoons.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The plot can be manipulated with the keyboard. The time axis can be expanded or "
"compressed using the <keycap>+</keycap> and <keycap>-</keycap> "
"keys. The time displayed at the center of the window can be changed with the "
"<keycap>[</keycap> and <keycap>]</keycap> keys."
msgstr ""
"Pode manipular o gráfico co teclado. O eixo do tempo pode expandirse ou "
"comprimirse mediante as teclas <keycap>+</keycap> e <keycap>-</keycap>. "
"A hora que se mostra no centro da fiestra pode mudarse coas teclas "
"<keycap>[</keycap> e <keycap>]</keycap>."

